">ち</span><span begin="25.607" end="25.846">の</span><span begin="25.846" end="26.240">声</span><span begin="26.240" end="27.049">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">多希望我们的呐喊</span></p><p begin="28.804" end="33.772" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.804" end="29.048">世</span><span begin="29.048" end="29.722">界</span><span begin="29.722" end="30.154">の</span><span begin="30.154" end="30.516">端</span><span begin="30.516" end="30.711">っ</span><span begin="30.711" end="30.919">こ</span><span begin="30.919" end="31.131">ま</span><span begin="31.131" end="31.380">で</span><span begin="31.380" end="31.608">消</span><span begin="31.608" end="31.824">え</span><span begin="31.824" end="32.099">る</span><span begin="32.423" end="32.659">こ</span><span begin="32.659" end="32.978">と</span><span begin="32.978" end="33.160">な</span><span begin="33.160" end="33.772">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一直响彻世界的尽头</span></p><p begin="34.388" end="38.246" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.388" end="35.062">届</span><span begin="35.062" end="35.287">い</span><span begin="35.287" end="35.724">た</span><span begin="35.724" end="35.869">り</span><span begin="35.869" end="36.033">し</span><span begin="36.033" end="36.481">た</span><span begin="36.481" end="36.659">ら</span><span begin="36.659" end="36.847">い</span><span begin="36.847" end="37.020">い</span><span begin="37.020" end="37.202">の</span><span begin="37.202" end="37.400">に</span><span begin="37.400" end="38.246">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">永远都不会消失</span></p><p begin="39.433" end="44.724" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.433" end="39.612">そ</span><span begin="39.612" end="39.801">し</span><span begin="39.801" end="40.005">た</span><span begin="40.005" end="40.500">ら</span><span begin="40.500" end="40.695">ね</span><span begin="40.695" end="40.919">ぇ</span><span begin="40.919" end="41.296">二</span><span begin="41.296" end="41.509">人</span><span begin="41.509" end="41.886">で</span> <span begin="42.277" end="42.442">ど</span><span begin="42.442" end="42.627">ん</span><span begin="42.627" end="42.796">な</span><span begin="42.796" end="43.333">言</span><span begin="43.333" end="43.495">葉</span><span begin="43.495" end="43.658">を</span><span begin="43.658" end="44.211">放</span><span begin="44.211" end="44.465">と</span><span begin="44.465" end="44.724">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果可以 那么我们又该说些什么好呢</span></p><p begin="44.984" end="51.365" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.984" end="45.165">消</span><span begin="45.165" end="45.320">え</span><span begin="45.320" end="45.493">る</span><span begin="45.493" end="45.877">こ</span><span begin="45.877" end="46.056">と</span><span begin="46.056" end="46.223">な</span><span begin="46.223" end="46.389">い</span><span begin="46.389" end="46.941">約</span><span begin="46.941" end="47.449">束</span><span begin="47.661" end="47.864">を</span> <span begin="47.864" end="48.194">二</span><span begin="48.194" end="48.401">人</span><span begin="48.401" end="48.801">で</span><span begin="49.046" end="49.191">「</span><span begin="49.191" end="49.359">せ</span><span begin="49.359" end="49.534">ー</span><span begin="49.534" end="49.681">の</span><span begin="49.681" end="49.829">」</span><span begin="49.829" end="50.391">で</span><span begin="50.787" end="50.971">言</span><span begin="50.971" end="51.167">お</span><span begin="51.167" end="51.365">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不如就一起喊“一二” 定下一个永不消失的约定</span></p><p begin="1:02.083" end="1:05.137" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.083" end="1:02.247">あ</span><span begin="1:02.247" end="1:02.436">ぁ</span><span begin="1:02.436" end="1:02.578">「</span><span begin="1:02.578" end="1:02.911">願</span><span begin="1:02.911" end="1:03.084">っ</span><span begin="1:03.084" end="1:03.244">た</span><span begin="1:03.244" end="1:03.403">ら</span><span begin="1:03.403" end="1:03.568">な</span><span be